### servico-auth - exemplos de requisicoes
### Pode ser executado direto no servico (porta 8084) ou via API Gateway (porta 8080, prefixo /api)

@directUrl = http://localhost:8084
@gatewayUrl = http://localhost:8080/api

### Registrar credencial (via gateway)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### Tentar registrar o mesmo email de novo -> 409
POST {{directUrl}}/auth/registrar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "senha": "outrasenha"
}

### Login com credenciais validas -> 200 com accessToken e refreshToken
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "senha": "senha123"
}

### Login com senha incorreta -> 401
POST {{directUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ana@example.com",
  "senha": "senhaerrada"
}

### Login com email inexistente -> 401
POST {{directUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "naoexiste@example.com",
  "senha": "qualquer"
}

### Renovar o access token usando o refreshToken retornado no login
### (substitua REFRESH_TOKEN pelo valor retornado acima)
POST {{gatewayUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REFRESH_TOKEN"
}

### Tentar renovar com um refresh token invalido -> 401
POST {{directUrl}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "token-invalido"
}
